Round complete. Both deliverable files are written (`impl/d1_pow2.c`, `strategies/d1_pow2.md`), all 87 correctness checks pass on the scoring node, tryout is green with bitwise repeatability, and the slot lease is released.

Technique ended on: transpose-first stride-1 stage with block-lane full-width split twiddle SCMULs, gated to cache-resident working sets (L≤2048, 32·L·B≤2MB) after PMU showed port-5/instruction count — not fills or split-radix — was the 1024 bottleneck; best wallaby us/xf B=1 m=1: 0.012/0.030/0.077/0.789/5.26/24.9 for L=32/64/128/1024/4096/16384, batched: 0.012/0.028/0.095/1.43/6.84/32.0; rel L2 ≤ 3.9e-16 single-call, worst chain gate 7.1e-12 vs the 1e-10 floor (and 1024 B=1 now beats MKL same-core on the scoring node, 1.19 vs 1.23 us).
